@dsh-external/dsh-session-folders README · Usage：Open the Web UI and use the folder tree above the session list:

- right-click a session or folder to open its action menu;
- drag a session onto a folder to move it;
- nest, recolour, change the icon or collapse folders;
- use batch selection to move several sessions at once.

The REST API is served at `/@dsh-external/dsh-session-folders/api`.

